Subject: [PATCH 67/69] dt-bindings: sram: qcom,imem: Add SM7250

Add the SM7250 IMEM compatible, and allow it the reboot-mode child like
the older SoCs whose bootloaders read the restart reason from IMEM.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sram/qcom,imem.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sram/qcom,imem.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sram/qcom,imem.yaml
index 2f120376a..1a2cb288d 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sram/qcom,imem.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sram/qcom,imem.yaml
@@ -40,6 +40,7 @@ properties:
           - qcom,sm6350-imem
           - qcom,sm6375-imem
           - qcom,sm7150-imem
+          - qcom,sm7250-imem
           - qcom,sm8150-imem
           - qcom,sm8250-imem
           - qcom,sm8350-imem
@@ -113,6 +114,7 @@ allOf:
               - qcom,apq8064-imem
               - qcom,msm8226-imem
               - qcom,msm8974-imem
+              - qcom,sm7250-imem
     then:
       properties:
         reboot-mode:
